# Back to the defaults on Graphics before the GPU probe has answered
# (bugs.md LUI.8): done once it has, on the software renderer where it
# found no GPU driver. test_ui_scripts.c makes the probe's dxl-cli one that
# finds none, 3 s slow, and reads Settings.json.
wait 1.5
expect home
find Settings
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings
find Graphics
key Return
wait 0.3
expect settings Graphics
find Back to the defaults
key Return
wait 0.3
expect confirm
find Reset
key Return
wait 5
expect settings Graphics
quit
